@startuml
title RuleSphere - Activity Diagram\n03. Governance and Artifact Build | UC-10..14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #FFF6DF
skinparam activityBorderColor #496477
|Decision Author|
start
:Submit exact candidate revision;
|Control Plane|
:Authorize submit and validate candidate revision;
if (Authorized and required validation passed?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Return errors; do not enter review;
  stop
endif
:Calculate risk from change scope,\nschema compatibility and previous 30-day traffic;
:Bind candidate revision and policy; enter In Review;
:Derive required stages / quorum;
note right
Tier 1: one Domain Approver.
Tier 2: Domain Peer THEN Workspace Owner.
Tier 3: Domain Owner AND Compliance Officer.
Maker is excluded from every approval role.
end note
while (Governance still pending?) is (yes)
  |Authorized Reviewer|
  :Submit approve / reject / upward override command;
  |Control Plane|
  :Check current scope, role, maker exclusion,\nstage and candidate revision;
  if (Reviewer and command eligible?) then (yes)
    switch (Command)
    case (Increase tier)
      if (New tier is higher?) then (yes)
        :Record immutable override evidence;
        :Increase tier and re-evaluate required approvals;
        note right
Reuse of prior approvals needs explicit policy.
An edited revision cannot inherit approval implicitly.
end note
      else (no)
        :Reject same/lower-tier override;
      endif
    case (Reject)
      :Append immutable rejection evidence;
      :Return candidate to Draft;
      stop
    case (Approve)
      :Append immutable approval evidence\nfor the reviewed revision;
      :Evaluate current stages / quorum;
    endswitch
  else (no)
    :Reject command without counting approval;
  endif
  :Expose current review status;
endwhile (no)
:Mark Approved and freeze Decision Version;
|Artifact Builder|
:Verify governed revision and required validation;
if (Build preconditions satisfied?) then (yes)
  :Build artifact binding exact graph, schemas,\ndependencies and Shared Library versions;
  if (Build succeeded?) then (yes)
    :Store immutable artifact, manifest and integrity metadata;
    :Expose artifact as eligible for delivery;
  else (no)
    :Report observable build failure; no deliverable artifact;
  endif
else (no)
  :Block build and report precondition failure;
endif
stop
legend bottom
  Human review commands are separate requests over time, not an open HTTP call.
  Approved does not mean Active. This activity describes governance, not a BPM engine.
endlegend
@enduml
